{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43269","headline":"天骥呈材 · 郑蕡","name":"天骥呈材","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"毛骨合天经，拳奇步骤轻。\n曾邀于阗驾，新出贰师营。\n喷勒金铃响，追风汗血生。\n酒亭留去迹，吴坂认嘶声。\n力可通衢试，材堪圣代呈。\n王良如故盻，垂耳欲长鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑蕡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}